abstract: >-
  Formal architectural whitepaper and protocol specification (BT-Spec v1.0) for BabelTele (巴别语 / 巴别塔电报),
  a model-native high-density semantic communication and memory system for Large Language Models.
  Synthesizes foundational empirical findings (arXiv:2606.19857) into three core axioms, six tokenizer-grounded
  operator clusters, four standardized compression tiers (BT-L0 to BT-L3), MCP/A2A five-layer protocol integration,
  Semantic Merkle Folding Trees (SMFT), and a Three-Tier Deterministic Safety Audit Gateway.
